    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A character who has funds on deposit in a Kundarak bank can request from the bank a letter of credit, which allows them to withdraw funds from a different bank branch. Letters of credit are always notarized with arcane marks (usually by gnomes from House Sivis), making them practically impossible to forge.</p>"
